  "implementation": [
    "Complete actual Session metadata includes private hash/origin/request buffers, original profile/catalog/design children and conservative repeated shared roots. Existing science and independent numerical bodies are preserved.",
    "GUI Designer holds Retained<Session>. Begin admits the actual candidate before replacing its previous owner. Preview borrows this same charged owner.",
    "Generation and export each request a separately admitted actual Session clone on the canonical host. The retained input moves into its real worker closure, preserving the charge until actual completion/drop even when GUI state is replaced or destroyed.",
    "Failed Session replacement/copy preserves prior controls/profile/original metadata. Export preparation keeps a previous Ready snapshot until parse/copy admission/spawn succeeds; no premature take remains.",
    "Existing UTF-8 recipe, playback-selection and export-scope input ceilings now have separate named constants. Equal recipe/playback values retain distinct purposes; values, boundary operators and diagnostics remain unchanged.",
    "Request/control/worker envelopes, generated capture queues and export Prepared products remain separately pending. This is Session input acceptance, not complete worker-output or SESSION acceptance. No scientific/public API, binding, schema, dependency or CXX/QML registration change."
  ],
